[ti:Sorry, Sir.]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.79]Lesson 3 | 第3课
[00:02.98]Sorry sir. | 对不起,先生。
[00:05.75]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.71]Does the man get his umbrella back? | 那位先生要回他的雨伞了吗?
[00:17.56]My coat and my umbrella please. | 请把我的外套和雨伞给我。
[00:22.00]Here is my ticket. | 这是我的票。
[00:25.03]Thank you sir. | 谢谢你,先生。
[00:26.86]Number five. | 五号。
[00:29.09]Here's your umbrella and your coat. | 这是您的雨伞和外套。
[00:33.72]This is not my umbrella. | 这不是我的雨伞。
[00:37.39]Sorry sir. | 对不起,先生。
[00:39.67]Is this your umbrella? | 这是您的雨伞吗?
[00:42.56]No it isn't. | 不,不是的。
[00:45.69]Is this it? | 这把是吗?
[00:47.76]Yes it is. | 是的,是这把。
[00:50.53]Thank you very much. | 非常感谢。